<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly update of New Mexico cattle exports to Mexico, to May 31 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     306	    11,428	 N/A</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   1	 N/A</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    10	     2,340	 N/A</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females   214	     3,339	 N/A</p>
